# A drive without a diskette, a fixed disk without a partition (roadmap
# os-server.md P9): errors, never a hang.
program: sh
media: B ejected
media: D blank
emulators: bochs mame
keys: ls /b; ls /d; echo x > /b/x.txt\n
---
rx286, test build
/a$ ls /b; ls /d; echo x > /b/x.txt
/b: input/output error
/d: input/output error
sh: /b/x.txt: input/output error
/a$
